1
00:02:04,110 --> 00:02:08,280
No living creature was hurt
during the production of this film.

2
00:02:16,325 --> 00:02:21,675
Visit our website for more: turkision.com

3
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:55,039
You are a demon, Ismihan!

4
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:08,759
You are a demon! A demon!

5
00:03:09,040 --> 00:03:10,479
I did not do anything to you!

6
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:12,999
No one will believe this slander!

7
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:16,629
You will drown in the blood of the
innocent people you murdered!

8
00:03:16,629 --> 00:03:20,919
Even though I killed Esma,
and caused this wound...

9
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:25,559
...this dagger...

10
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:28,759
...is yours, Malhun.

11
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:38,239
I have witnesses, too.

12
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,199
Take her!

13
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:13,879
I have witnesses.

14
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:16,879
Right, Bengi Hatun?

15
00:04:18,519 --> 00:04:19,879
I haven't seen anything.

16
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:21,478
Anything.

17
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,199
Get up!

18
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:26,119
I said get up Bengi!

19
00:04:28,200 --> 00:04:30,599
Esma tried to kill me.

20
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:33,679
And she failed.
So I killed her.

21
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:35,239
What have you done?

22
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:36,479
Esma was so young.

23
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:38,399
Esma was my daughter!

24
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:41,279
Esma failed. So Malhun...

25
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:44,639
..tried to kill me.

26
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:50,519
She tried to stab me.

27
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:52,119
And you saw it.

28
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:56,559
Celali saw it too.

29
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:04,439
You will come to the trial..

30
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:06,439
...and give testimony.

31
00:05:07,200 --> 00:05:08,719
Do you understand me, Bengi?

32
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,879
Esma didn't do anything.

33
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:13,279
She wouldn’t speak.

34
00:05:13,280 --> 00:05:15,279
You wasted Esma.

35
00:05:15,280 --> 00:05:17,719
She was only going to leave
with her sibling.

36
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:18,919
I told you.

37
00:05:19,400 --> 00:05:22,479
If you want power, you can't have mercy.

38
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:25,519
You can't show any weakness Bengi Hatun!

39
00:05:25,520 --> 00:05:27,719
Now go and bury her.

40
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:31,319
Then come to the trial and
give your testimony.

41
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:38,559
If you dare to go against me
for that poor girl..

42
00:05:39,840 --> 00:05:42,399
...this time I’ll take your daughter
to whom you gave birth...

43
00:05:43,280 --> 00:05:45,719
..not the one you only raised.

44
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:51,999
You're a smart woman.

45
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:54,279
Use your head.

46
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:06,599
Alps!

47
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:10,319
We won't stand down
against Ismihan's trap.

48
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:12,799
She did too much..

49
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:14,649
...and I don't have any patience left.

50
00:06:14,649 --> 00:06:17,199
I won't let that cruel woman
have my mother!

51
00:06:17,200 --> 00:06:18,999
Everyone get on your horses!

52
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:21,959
We're going to Sogut. Come on.

53
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,999
Brother.

54
00:06:24,680 --> 00:06:27,079
We're going without consulting anyone.

55
00:06:27,080 --> 00:06:28,399
But father...

56
00:06:28,400 --> 00:06:31,799
When the situation is like this
we can't stand still. No.

57
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:34,319
Ismihan wants to bring
my mother to the rope.

58
00:06:34,320 --> 00:06:36,999
We can't lose even a moment.

59
00:06:44,440 --> 00:06:45,959
Mother?

60
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:51,039
Sons..

61
00:06:54,280 --> 00:06:55,839
Mother.

62
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:58,119
Mother Malhun..

63
00:06:58,120 --> 00:07:00,119
We know. We know it all.

64
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:02,079
First, we need to be calm.

65
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:05,199
After I get my mother I can be calm.

66
00:07:05,200 --> 00:07:07,079
Son.

67
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,399
Hold on.

68
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:10,079
How can I Mother Bala?

69
00:07:10,080 --> 00:07:12,319
Are we going to stand down against
what Ismihan has done?

70
00:07:12,320 --> 00:07:16,199
When did we accept it before
that we would accept it now, Orhan Bey?

71
00:07:16,200 --> 00:07:17,399
Don't worry.

72
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:19,619
Osman Bey is at Sogut
right now with his alps.

73
00:07:19,619 --> 00:07:20,829
He's doing what’s needed.

74
00:07:20,829 --> 00:07:23,119
I don't want to go against
your word but...

75
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:24,719
..I can't wait here mother Bala.

76
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:27,599
It's Osman Bey's order, Orhan Bey.

77
00:07:30,760 --> 00:07:35,519
You and Alaeddin will protect Yenisehir.

78
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,959
As my bey wishes.

79
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:48,239
Orhan.

80
00:07:52,760 --> 00:07:56,479
Nayman is waiting for us
to leave this place unprotected.

81
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,639
This duty is a hard one.

82
00:07:58,640 --> 00:08:00,119
Don't you see it?

83
00:08:03,400 --> 00:08:05,399
You will protect this place.

84
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:10,319
I will go ask Bengi about the truth.
She saw everything that happened.

85
00:08:13,440 --> 00:08:14,839
Let's go.

86
00:08:27,880 --> 00:08:29,319
Malhun Hatun did it.

87
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:30,399
She did!

88
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:33,999
She made a move on Mother Sultan's life!

89
00:08:34,440 --> 00:08:36,198
She needs to be punished.

90
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:38,839
A trial should be held!

91
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:41,719
How could she?

92
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:46,279
-How could she do this?
-Listen, people!

93
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:50,599
People who'd do this will have
no mercy on us in the future!

94
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:53,039
He’s right!

95
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:55,879
They say Malhun Hatun did this
because of her arrogance.

96
00:08:56,040 --> 00:08:57,799
She should be punished.

97
00:08:57,800 --> 00:08:59,599
She should be.

98
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:06,599
Even if it's a Bey’s Hatun,
the punishment should be harsh!

99
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:08,559
He’s right!

100
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:11,719
She needs to be punished!

101
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:18,519
We will find out the truth!

102
00:09:18,800 --> 00:09:20,999
We will not leave our Sultan alone!

103
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:25,039
Let's have a trial and punish her!

104
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:36,399
Ismihan!

105
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:19,519
I hope you are not unhappy here, Malhun.

106
00:11:20,800 --> 00:11:22,399
am not, Ismihan.

107
00:11:22,840 --> 00:11:28,039
But when I put you in here, you will be!

108
00:11:36,160 --> 00:11:42,639
You will be crushed beneath
the dreams you have!

109
00:11:53,400 --> 00:12:00,199
You cross the line,
and then you pay the price!

110
00:12:07,040 --> 00:12:09,999
Are you going to make me pay
with slanders?

111
00:12:12,680 --> 00:12:14,439
Look at>that.

112
00:12:15,680 --> 00:12:17,079
Guards.

113
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:24,559
Malhun Hatun wants to finish
what she left unfinished.

114
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:31,959
If I wanted to kill you,
you wouldn’t even be able to talk here!

115
00:12:34,520 --> 00:12:37,759
And I would pay the price for it!

116
00:12:43,080 --> 00:12:45,799
You are pitiful, Malhun!

117
00:12:46,640 --> 00:12:48,999
And what's worse is...

118
00:12:49,520 --> 00:12:52,119
...that you thought you could forgive me!

119
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:54,999
Neither you...

120
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:58,319
...nor Osman Bey.

121
00:12:58,800 --> 00:13:05,519
You are just grass that I crush under my feet
while I am on the path to power!

122
00:13:09,520 --> 00:13:12,519
You are confusing a
plane tree with grass, Ismihan!

123
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:15,079
We will see.

124
00:13:16,480 --> 00:13:21,919
Let's see if you will be able to step on us,
or are you going to be crushed under us!?

125
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:26,039
The humidity here is making Malhun go mad.

126
00:13:32,160 --> 00:13:34,959
She sees impossible .dreams.

127
00:13:39,120 --> 00:13:40,519
Take her out.

128
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:44,479
Fresh air will be good for her.

129
00:13:47,320 --> 00:13:49,279
Where are you taking me?

130
00:13:49,280 --> 00:13:51,199
You will see.

131
00:13:59,200 --> 00:14:01,599
My Bey, what should we do?
What are your orders?

132
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:06,759
Wait a second, they riled up the folks.

133
00:14:06,920 --> 00:14:08,319
We will see.

134
00:14:09,200 --> 00:14:10,639
We will see.

135
00:14:36,840 --> 00:14:37,999
Osman Bey!

136
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:39,439
Stop.

137
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:43,879
What’s going on? Malhun Hatun
attempted to kill our Sultan.

138
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:47,719
Where is your justice?
We trusted your justice!

139
00:14:48,160 --> 00:14:51,239
Calm down. Do you hear what you're saying?

140
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:52,879
Do you know who you're talking to?

141
00:14:52,879 --> 00:14:55,279
Calm down. Just stop.

142
00:14:55,280 --> 00:14:56,759
What are you doing?

143
00:14:57,480 --> 00:14:58,759
That's not true.

144
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:02,799
Calm down.

145
00:15:38,920 --> 00:15:41,119
We took precautions, Mother Sultan.

146
00:15:41,120 --> 00:15:42,919
People are gathering.

147
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:45,959
Good, Karabul.
Good.

148
00:15:55,880 --> 00:15:57,679
My hands are chained.

149
00:15:58,520 --> 00:16:00,519
And your heart's in chains Ismihan.

150
00:16:02,200 --> 00:16:04,279
You're so scared of us.

151
00:16:06,200 --> 00:16:08,119
I don't fear for my life.

152
00:16:08,640 --> 00:16:11,879
I only worry about the future of my state.

153
00:16:12,800 --> 00:16:14,839
Even if...

154
00:16:15,040 --> 00:16:17,839
...a little ant was to
give my state trouble...

155
00:16:18,640 --> 00:16:20,599
...I would fight back.

156
00:16:21,080 --> 00:16:23,159
The future of the state?

157
00:16:25,040 --> 00:16:26,999
Don't fool yourself Ismihan.

158
00:16:27,280 --> 00:16:29,199
You only worry about Osman Bey.

159
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:31,599
You are..

160
00:16:32,400 --> 00:16:34,679
...so incredibly full of hatred...

161
00:16:34,920 --> 00:16:38,519
...that you work with those
who are Turk's enemies.

162
00:16:38,760 --> 00:16:39,879
Hatun!

163
00:16:41,320 --> 00:16:43,159
Wait Celali. Wait.

164
00:16:43,160 --> 00:16:44,399
Let her speak.

165
00:16:46,200 --> 00:16:47,479
You talk about..

166
00:16:48,280 --> 00:16:49,919
...the state and the future.

167
00:16:50,600 --> 00:16:53,839
But you side with those
who will destroy the state...

168
00:16:54,400 --> 00:16:57,199
..and show no mercy to our children.

169
00:16:58,840 --> 00:17:00,039
And then..

170
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:02,359
...you claim we're the scapegoat.

171
00:17:04,400 --> 00:17:05,598
Ismihan.

172
00:17:06,640 --> 00:17:08,199
How will you die?

173
00:17:10,800 --> 00:17:14,719
You'll never see it Malhun Hatun.

174
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:17,079
Because you..

175
00:17:17,400 --> 00:17:20,999
...tried to kill
Mother Sultan of Great Seljuk.

176
00:17:22,160 --> 00:17:24,239
You won't live that long.

177
00:17:29,040 --> 00:17:29,719
See?

178
00:17:30,600 --> 00:17:31,599
See?

179
00:17:32,720 --> 00:17:38,359
Even the people know that
every breath you take from now on...

180
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:40,599
...is a waste.

181
00:17:46,720 --> 00:17:49,279
Soldiers! Open the gates.

182
00:18:08,160 --> 00:18:10,599
There must be a punishment for murder!

183
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:22,319
Let me pass.

184
00:18:25,960 --> 00:18:26,959
My Bey.

185
00:18:27,240 --> 00:18:28,959
Let us push through.

186
00:18:29,720 --> 00:18:30,999
Wait.

187
00:18:32,600 --> 00:18:33,999
Let me pass.

188
00:18:43,800 --> 00:18:44,719
Osman!

189
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:51,039
Osman I'm okay. Don't worry.

190
00:18:57,600 --> 00:18:58,799
Malhun.

191
00:19:44,560 --> 00:19:45,559
Malhun.

192
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:57,479
Get your sword Osman Bey.

193
00:19:57,480 --> 00:19:58,399
Get it.

194
00:19:58,800 --> 00:20:04,119
Get it so the people can see that you're
made from the same cloth as your hatun.

195
00:20:09,720 --> 00:20:12,119
Don't you feel shame at all?

196
00:20:12,520 --> 00:20:17,959
How can you come to all Seljuk's Mother
Sultan's land without permission like this?

197
00:20:19,720 --> 00:20:21,959
Everyone! Do you see?

198
00:20:36,360 --> 00:20:41,999
If there's someone who's not afraid of Allah
and feeling shame, then it's you, Mother Sultan.

199
00:20:44,960 --> 00:20:48,519
How can you throw my hatun into jail?

200
00:20:49,880 --> 00:20:51,759
Everyone saw it.

201
00:20:51,760 --> 00:20:55,799
Everyone knows what a traitor you are now.

202
00:20:58,480 --> 00:21:02,719
Malhun came here with ill intent
with her spy.

203
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:08,799
First that assassin Esma...

204
00:21:08,800 --> 00:21:10,999
And when she couldn't do it..

205
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:13,039
...herself.

206
00:21:28,200 --> 00:21:29,359
Here.

207
00:21:32,360 --> 00:21:35,599
Your hatun’s bloody knife.

208
00:21:49,440 --> 00:21:52,399
She has to pay for it. She has to.

209
00:21:53,600 --> 00:21:55,999
She has to pay.

210
00:21:58,080 --> 00:22:00,879
If she's guilty let her pay for her crimes.

211
00:22:12,040 --> 00:22:13,959
Mother Sultan..

212
00:22:18,400 --> 00:22:21,799
So you've played the biggest move there is huh?

213
00:22:29,680 --> 00:22:31,919
You spilled the blood.

214
00:22:31,920 --> 00:22:34,599
You threw the slander.

215
00:22:35,200 --> 00:22:37,839
Now you're telling me
to wait for the last move.

216
00:22:40,600 --> 00:22:42,119
Tell me.

217
00:22:43,080 --> 00:22:44,999
Where did you see me stop?

218
00:22:45,880 --> 00:22:48,559
Do you think I will let you do this?

219
00:22:49,480 --> 00:22:53,119
Everyone knows your
ill feelings towards me.

220
00:22:53,400 --> 00:22:57,239
Your hatun couldn't help her
anger and made a mistake.

221
00:22:58,360 --> 00:23:01,319
Don't you dare make a move.

222
00:23:01,320 --> 00:23:03,159
Osman Bey.

223
00:23:05,400 --> 00:23:09,599
If not I'll get you trialed
with your hatun.

224
00:23:27,720 --> 00:23:29,919
Mother Sultan.

225
00:23:31,080 --> 00:23:33,399
If I was going to make a move...

226
00:23:33,400 --> 00:23:36,419
...then I would've already destroyed
this place with you in it.

227
00:23:43,480 --> 00:23:46,559
I do everything accordingly and justly.

228
00:23:50,880 --> 00:23:52,399
But you...

229
00:23:52,400 --> 00:23:55,199
...should let go of my hatun
who you detained unjustly.

230
00:23:55,200 --> 00:23:58,399
-If not...
-People...

231
00:23:59,440 --> 00:24:01,839
..look at my wound.

232
00:24:01,840 --> 00:24:06,799
-Get her hanged!
-Get her hanged!

233
00:24:06,800 --> 00:24:11,479
Look at what these rebels have done
to all Seljuk's Mother Sultan.

234
00:24:11,920 --> 00:24:16,599
Now you come here without shame..

235
00:24:16,600 --> 00:24:18,679
...threatening me.

236
00:24:19,880 --> 00:24:21,879
She will pay for it.

237
00:24:22,440 --> 00:24:24,199
Since he’s a bey...

238
00:24:24,200 --> 00:24:26,199
...he wants to be treated differently.

239
00:24:26,200 --> 00:24:27,759
Since he’s a bey...

240
00:24:28,160 --> 00:24:31,679
..he wants to be above the law.

241
00:24:35,000 --> 00:24:37,719
Do you see your Osman Bey now?

242
00:24:37,720 --> 00:24:40,519
Is this something that can be done
to Seljuks Sultan?

243
00:24:40,520 --> 00:24:43,439
Even if it's Osman, he's going to
be held accountable!

244
00:25:17,600 --> 00:25:18,959
Mother!

245
00:25:19,200 --> 00:25:20,799
Speak!

246
00:25:21,240 --> 00:25:22,999
What happened?

247
00:25:23,200 --> 00:25:26,319
Who did this to my sister?

248
00:25:27,600 --> 00:25:29,319
I couldn't stop them.

249
00:25:32,000 --> 00:25:33,839
I couldn't stop them...

250
00:25:34,320 --> 00:25:36,279
Ismihan..

251
00:25:37,080 --> 00:25:38,999
Ismihan killed her.

252
00:25:41,440 --> 00:25:43,399
Malhun,.

253
00:25:43,840 --> 00:25:45,679
Malhun was the reason.

254
00:25:47,400 --> 00:25:49,199
They were the reason!

255
00:25:51,120 --> 00:25:53,239
What did Malhun do, mother?

256
00:25:56,600 --> 00:25:58,759
What are you talking about?

257
00:26:02,680 --> 00:26:05,479
Say something, Baybars!

258
00:26:06,280 --> 00:26:10,199
Malhun Hatun sent Esma
to kill Mother Sultan.

259
00:26:13,400 --> 00:26:15,319
Since Esma got caught...

260
00:26:15,480 --> 00:26:18,799
..she tried to kill Mother Sultan herself.

261
00:26:20,560 --> 00:26:22,479
She’s now under arrest.

262
00:26:27,960 --> 00:26:30,159
Malhun Hatun, huh?

263
00:26:32,000 --> 00:26:34,119
I trusted them with my sister!

264
00:26:34,480 --> 00:26:37,679
Malhun wouldn't do that.

265
00:26:38,600 --> 00:26:41,599
Don't you hear them?

266
00:26:41,880 --> 00:26:43,719
Esma died!

267
00:26:43,800 --> 00:26:45,799
Whose side are you on?

268
00:26:46,280 --> 00:26:48,039
Alcicek.

269
00:26:48,200 --> 00:26:50,799
...you're speaking like
you don’t know her.

270
00:26:51,280 --> 00:26:54,599
-Attacking Ismihan-
-Open your eyes, Aktemur!

271
00:26:55,560 --> 00:26:59,599
Your uncle's wife used my sister
to kill Ismihan Sultan!

272
00:27:03,720 --> 00:27:06,599
From now on, both Ismihan Sultan...

273
00:27:07,160 --> 00:27:08,949
...and Malhun Hatun
are our enemies!

274
00:27:09,000 --> 00:27:11,399
Enough!

275
00:27:13,200 --> 00:27:15,399
Don't let your anger blind you.

276
00:27:16,400 --> 00:27:18,599
Don't speak further
until we know the truth.

277
00:27:18,760 --> 00:27:20,199
Quiet.

278
00:27:21,880 --> 00:27:23,559
We have a funeral.

279
00:27:23,720 --> 00:27:25,199
May I, my Bey?

280
00:27:25,520 --> 00:27:27,279
Come in, Kutlu.

281
00:27:32,800 --> 00:27:35,719
Bala Hatun is coming, my Bey.

282
00:27:37,840 --> 00:27:42,079
Also, they're waiting for you
for the funeral stuff.

283
00:27:55,600 --> 00:27:57,199
Alcicek..

284
00:27:58,800 --> 00:28:00,279
...go with Aktemur.

285
00:28:05,200 --> 00:28:06,119
Alcicek!

286
00:28:33,760 --> 00:28:35,679
My condolences.

287
00:28:48,080 --> 00:28:50,439
Well..

288
00:28:51,400 --> 00:28:53,519
..Mother Sultan.

289
00:28:57,760 --> 00:29:00,319
Seems Mother Sultan..

290
00:29:01,200 --> 00:29:03,799
...is preparing a significant sight.

291
00:29:06,720 --> 00:29:09,199
Well..

292
00:29:09,400 --> 00:29:11,519
...when there’s something to see...

293
00:29:11,640 --> 00:29:15,959
...people of course come out to watch.

294
00:29:20,200 --> 00:29:22,119
People!

295
00:29:25,000 --> 00:29:28,159
Truth isn't always laid out in front of us.

296
00:29:34,000 --> 00:29:36,519
People!

297
00:29:37,880 --> 00:29:41,199
The one who dreams
the same thing I dream of!

298
00:29:44,400 --> 00:29:46,399
Don't you...

299
00:29:47,240 --> 00:29:49,839
...make this mistake.

300
00:29:50,400 --> 00:29:52,399
Don't you...

301
00:29:52,920 --> 00:29:55,439
...believe the lies being spoken.

302
00:30:06,400 --> 00:30:09,519
If my hatun is guilty...

303
00:30:10,520 --> 00:30:13,799
...I will punish her myself.

304
00:30:25,600 --> 00:30:27,919
Mother Sultan, you speak of justice!

305
00:30:31,200 --> 00:30:33,759
You are unjust!

306
00:30:37,800 --> 00:30:43,399
The sword I carry is named
"sword of justice!" Now tell me...

307
00:30:45,200 --> 00:30:47,679
...have you ever seen me being...

308
00:30:48,880 --> 00:30:50,439
unjust?

309
00:31:08,680 --> 00:31:10,719
Mother Sultan.

310
00:31:11,440 --> 00:31:16,119
So you are saying that
you are playing this game carefully.

311
00:31:21,320 --> 00:31:25,479
You are saying that you are
so good at being evil, huh?

312
00:31:28,720 --> 00:31:31,359
But when what you did is revealed..

313
00:31:32,600 --> 00:31:35,799
...you will pay for it dearly!

314
00:31:36,480 --> 00:31:39,399
You can’t do anything, Osman Bey!

315
00:31:40,200 --> 00:31:42,999
Because justice is equal to everyone!

316
00:31:47,280 --> 00:31:49,719
Everyone is treated the same way!

317
00:31:52,600 --> 00:31:57,599
Malhun Hatun's trial will
be held today before dusk!

318
00:32:00,240 --> 00:32:05,039
Malhun Hatun will pay for the crimes
she committed against the state...

319
00:32:05,360 --> 00:32:08,639
...and me.

320
00:32:11,720 --> 00:32:14,439
And you, Osman Bey...

321
00:32:18,200 --> 00:32:20,999
...you will kneel before justice!

322
00:32:21,800 --> 00:32:23,999
Justice is for everyone.

323
00:32:25,160 --> 00:32:27,759
I obey the justice.

324
00:32:28,280 --> 00:32:30,079
But only the real one.

325
00:32:31,400 --> 00:32:33,399
Your justice is fake!

326
00:32:37,320 --> 00:32:40,199
You are just playing a game.

327
00:32:43,320 --> 00:32:45,959
And I am going to ruin that!

328
00:32:57,040 --> 00:32:58,839
Malhun.

329
00:32:59,200 --> 00:33:00,799
Don't worry.

330
00:33:12,880 --> 00:33:14,159
Alps.

331
00:33:30,680 --> 00:33:31,679
Come on.

332
00:33:42,120 --> 00:33:45,959
Who brought Esma there, Bengi Hatun?

333
00:33:48,200 --> 00:33:49,599
Tell me.

334
00:33:50,640 --> 00:33:52,719
You called Esma there.

335
00:33:54,080 --> 00:33:56,239
You wanted her to be hushed,
and scare her.

336
00:33:58,000 --> 00:34:01,919
I don't know if you had known
whether she would die or not.

337
00:34:04,400 --> 00:34:08,399
But her blood is not on our hands,
it's on yours.

338
00:34:15,679 --> 00:34:19,518
We did not harm Esma or Ismihan.

339
00:34:20,400 --> 00:34:22,399
Your ambition for power did.

340
00:34:23,199 --> 00:34:26,319
You sacrificed Esma to your nafs

341
00:34:44,159 --> 00:34:45,599
Leave, Bala.

342
00:34:49,480 --> 00:34:52,559
I have nothing else to say.

343
00:34:56,800 --> 00:35:00,119
I have no daughter to lose either.

344
00:35:13,280 --> 00:35:14,719
I see your pain.

345
00:35:16,080 --> 00:35:19,119
I know there’s a mother
inside of you that lives.

346
00:35:22,400 --> 00:35:23,799
I'm not talking to you.

347
00:35:24,760 --> 00:35:26,759
I'm talking to the mother inside you.

348
00:35:29,320 --> 00:35:31,799
Don't let your daughter's killer be free.

349
00:35:33,240 --> 00:35:35,479
Tell the truth in court.

350
00:35:37,520 --> 00:35:39,279
Let's end Ismihan together.

351
00:35:41,880 --> 00:35:44,329
Don't let them keep Malhun away
from her children.

352
00:35:46,600 --> 00:35:47,999
May I come in?

353
00:35:57,600 --> 00:35:58,359
Come in.

354
00:36:02,120 --> 00:36:02,879
Aunt.

355
00:36:04,000 --> 00:36:05,599
They're waiting for the funeral.

356
00:36:15,320 --> 00:36:18,279
Nayman's Base

357
00:37:07,720 --> 00:37:10,079
Don’t! Nayman!

358
00:37:10,800 --> 00:37:12,279
Don't do this!

359
00:37:12,320 --> 00:37:14,279
If I gave you a job...

360
00:37:14,280 --> 00:37:16,279
...you have to do it in time.

361
00:37:16,800 --> 00:37:19,919
You will pay for your stupidity.

362
00:37:21,400 --> 00:37:22,359
Don't!

363
00:37:22,360 --> 00:37:23,759
Great Nayman!

364
00:37:24,400 --> 00:37:26,399
Don't do this!

365
00:37:31,200 --> 00:37:33,119
Great Nayman don’t!

366
00:37:33,160 --> 00:37:33,959
Don't!

367
00:37:54,000 --> 00:37:57,479
carry the parts of catapults
to the carriages.

368
00:37:58,480 --> 00:38:01,479
I won’t build the catapults here.

369
00:38:03,320 --> 00:38:04,239
Osman...

370
00:38:05,000 --> 00:38:07,799
...damaged us by killing the shaman.

371
00:38:08,000 --> 00:38:10,319
What will we do now,
Commander Nayman?

372
00:38:10,840 --> 00:38:12,359
Spirits are angry.

373
00:38:12,600 --> 00:38:14,359
Warriors want blood.

374
00:38:16,040 --> 00:38:17,079
Soon..

375
00:38:17,920 --> 00:38:22,439
...we will wash our swords with
Osman's blood.

376
00:38:24,360 --> 00:38:26,919
We'll water the plants with his blood.

377
00:38:28,240 --> 00:38:30,799
Erlik Han's anger...

378
00:38:30,800 --> 00:38:32,399
...will be felt by all.

379
00:38:51,280 --> 00:38:53,879
We'll finish building the catapults.

380
00:38:54,440 --> 00:38:56,919
Now I need the masters..

381
00:38:56,920 --> 00:38:59,839
...that the Lord is going to send me.

382
00:39:06,440 --> 00:39:07,839
Commander Nayman.

383
00:39:08,160 --> 00:39:10,039
Mother Sultan sent word.

384
00:39:35,560 --> 00:39:39,679
Ismihan arrested Osman's Hatun.

385
00:39:40,000 --> 00:39:44,279
She is trying to put Osman to trouble.

386
00:39:48,680 --> 00:39:51,239
Now it’s my turn.

387
00:39:51,720 --> 00:39:53,239
Erlik Han.

388
00:39:54,320 --> 00:39:56,599
Strengthen my sword with your rage.

389
00:39:56,600 --> 00:39:59,799
I'm going to separate Osman's head
from his body.

390
00:40:00,400 --> 00:40:03,799
From the animals feeding on
Yenisehir land...

391
00:40:03,800 --> 00:40:06,639
..to the kids in their cribs..

392
00:40:06,640 --> 00:40:09,759
...I'm going to kill them all.

393
00:40:14,400 --> 00:40:17,319
Commander Nayman,
The Lord of Bursa is coming.

394
00:40:31,200 --> 00:40:36,239
You'll never be able to build
the catapults Nayman.

395
00:40:43,920 --> 00:40:46,719
Are you trying to
get yourself filled brother?

396
00:40:46,720 --> 00:40:48,279
Bayindir Bey...

397
00:40:49,640 --> 00:40:51,919
Bayindir Bey sent this.

398
00:40:51,920 --> 00:40:53,399
So?

399
00:41:01,920 --> 00:41:04,119
It's from Osman Bey.

400
00:41:19,040 --> 00:41:24,279
The catapults Nayman is getting built
to attack us will be his end.

401
00:41:24,280 --> 00:41:25,439
It's time.

402
00:41:25,440 --> 00:41:29,399
You're going to take the catapults
out of the headquarters tomorrow.

403
00:41:46,120 --> 00:41:47,479
Boran.

404
00:41:47,480 --> 00:41:49,599
Send alps to Yenisehir.

405
00:41:50,000 --> 00:41:53,279
Those who are not there
for security will come with us.

406
00:41:54,800 --> 00:41:58,079
We're going to go to
that Sogut in such a way that...

407
00:41:58,080 --> 00:42:00,399
...we won't let them have Malhun.

408
00:42:00,400 --> 00:42:02,319
We'll get her somehow.

409
00:42:02,320 --> 00:42:05,639
My bey shouldn't we wait for the trail?

410
00:42:07,520 --> 00:42:11,519
Are we going to wait for the trail
Ismihan has created with her slander?

411
00:42:11,520 --> 00:42:12,719
Tell me Boran.

412
00:42:13,720 --> 00:42:15,079
No.

413
00:42:15,920 --> 00:42:18,479
Ismihan's sense of justice...

414
00:42:18,480 --> 00:42:21,679
...has been deceptive,
she only cares for her own gain.

415
00:42:22,080 --> 00:42:23,799
We will get our justice...

416
00:42:23,800 --> 00:42:26,479
...through our own swords.

417
00:42:26,520 --> 00:42:28,039
EyvAllah my bey.

418
00:42:29,600 --> 00:42:33,039
My Bey, she has the people on her side too,
going there...

419
00:42:34,360 --> 00:42:39,999
By turning my people against me,
she wants to tarnish my reputation.

420
00:42:40,800 --> 00:42:43,479
If we stay silent against this...

421
00:42:43,480 --> 00:42:46,559
...then we would be accepting the slander.

422
00:42:52,400 --> 00:42:54,799
That fake trial of hers is hers...

423
00:42:54,800 --> 00:42:56,599
...and the field is ours.

424
00:42:56,600 --> 00:42:59,039
Eyvallah my bey.

425
00:42:59,040 --> 00:43:00,479
These lands are ours.

426
00:43:00,480 --> 00:43:01,799
Eyvallah my bey.

427
00:43:01,800 --> 00:43:03,199
Ismihan will end too.

428
00:43:03,200 --> 00:43:04,719
Insallah my bey.

429
00:43:04,720 --> 00:43:07,599
But people will know the truth.

430
00:43:08,680 --> 00:43:09,759
Kumral.

431
00:43:10,600 --> 00:43:15,199
With the ahis you're going to
go around the bazaar and all.

432
00:43:15,200 --> 00:43:20,799
The people will learn about all the ill intended things
Ismihan has done until today one by one.

433
00:43:21,400 --> 00:43:23,439
As you wish my bey.

434
00:43:25,400 --> 00:43:26,399
My Bey.

435
00:43:29,360 --> 00:43:31,759
Are we planning a move
against the trial my bey?

436
00:43:32,200 --> 00:43:34,319
We always have a move ready.

437
00:43:35,000 --> 00:43:36,399
Now the people...

438
00:43:36,400 --> 00:43:39,959
...will come closer to the
truth with Kumral Abdal.

439
00:43:40,320 --> 00:43:42,839
And when the trial comes..

440
00:43:43,960 --> 00:43:47,039
...they will see the truth.

441
00:44:04,920 --> 00:44:06,199
Osman.

442
00:44:07,440 --> 00:44:11,719
The rule you've been trying
to accomplish till now...

443
00:44:14,800 --> 00:44:19,999
...is going down with such a
small dagger wound.

444
00:44:22,520 --> 00:44:24,039
Soon.

445
00:44:29,360 --> 00:44:33,239
What do the men
you put to follow Bayindir say?

446
00:44:33,240 --> 00:44:36,919
They're going to tell us if
something important happens, Mother Sultan.

447
00:44:37,400 --> 00:44:39,559
They're keeping their eyes on him.

448
00:44:40,000 --> 00:44:44,039
He left Nayman's headquarters
and went to his shop.

449
00:44:48,840 --> 00:44:52,519
He couldn't find the spy he was talking about
in Nayman's headquarters.

450
00:44:53,800 --> 00:44:56,599
He’s going to use his gold.

451
00:44:59,400 --> 00:45:02,519
Bring him to me after the trial.

452
00:45:06,280 --> 00:45:08,479
Mother Sultan...

453
00:45:09,080 --> 00:45:10,799
...speaking about the trial...

454
00:45:11,000 --> 00:45:15,759
All your efforts can't be simply
to bring Malhun Hatun's death.

455
00:45:17,440 --> 00:45:19,079
At least that's what I think.

456
00:45:20,320 --> 00:45:21,839
Karavul..

457
00:45:22,320 --> 00:45:25,599
...you know they only act on
Osman Bey's orders.

458
00:45:26,640 --> 00:45:29,359
Malhun was simply following his orders.

459
00:45:30,160 --> 00:45:33,359
Once Malhun's guilt is proven...

460
00:45:34,240 --> 00:45:36,879
...Osman will be tried as well.

461
00:45:39,400 --> 00:45:41,519
So the trial is not being held for Malhun...

462
00:45:42,600 --> 00:45:44,919
...it’s being held for Osman.

463
00:45:47,200 --> 00:45:49,479
Mother Sultan..

464
00:45:51,120 --> 00:45:52,199
Bengi Hatun...

465
00:45:53,360 --> 00:45:54,959
What about Bengi Hatun?

466
00:45:55,480 --> 00:45:57,199
What if the Hatun speaks?

467
00:46:00,400 --> 00:46:03,119
Her daughter, her tribe, her life..

468
00:46:03,920 --> 00:46:07,199
There's too much she'd be risking, Celali.

469
00:46:09,800 --> 00:46:14,679
My wrath would always be on her.

470
00:46:16,960 --> 00:46:22,119
Bengi would never cross me.

471
00:46:53,280 --> 00:46:56,919
So you're planning to be
the Mongolian Emperor...

472
00:46:57,240 --> 00:47:00,119
...from this little tent of yours, Nayman...

473
00:47:03,160 --> 00:47:05,759
..and you want me on your side.

474
00:47:07,160 --> 00:47:10,199
You first killed my messengers..

475
00:47:10,760 --> 00:47:13,679
...and now you're here.

476
00:47:15,000 --> 00:47:17,039
You would sacrifice not 3..

477
00:47:17,360 --> 00:47:20,199
..but 3000 of your soldiers..

478
00:47:20,480 --> 00:47:23,919
...to become my ally, Nayman.

479
00:47:25,440 --> 00:47:28,799
What Osman told you was right.

480
00:47:28,800 --> 00:47:33,799
If you're my ally,
you will be Gazhan Han's enemy.

481
00:47:34,760 --> 00:47:38,359
But I already made you my offer.

482
00:47:39,960 --> 00:47:42,959
What you'll get in return will be great.

483
00:47:43,600 --> 00:47:47,399
What is it that you have and I don't?

484
00:47:49,560 --> 00:47:51,999
Things that you've lost.

485
00:47:52,400 --> 00:47:55,599
Byzantines lost a lot of things.

486
00:47:56,160 --> 00:47:58,199
Wouldn't it be nice to get revenge...

487
00:47:58,800 --> 00:48:02,199
...and take back what you've lost?

488
00:48:05,240 --> 00:48:06,759
I'm listening.

489
00:48:07,400 --> 00:48:10,879
I will kill Gazhan Han.

490
00:48:12,760 --> 00:48:16,599
Konya and all borders will be mine.

491
00:48:17,320 --> 00:48:20,719
Konya has been doing poorly
in the hands of the Muslims.

492
00:48:21,520 --> 00:48:24,999
Borders have been suffering
under Osman’s control.

493
00:48:26,320 --> 00:48:29,079
I will let you have all of them.

494
00:48:30,280 --> 00:48:33,679
You will be written as the man
who revived the Byzantines...

495
00:48:33,880 --> 00:48:36,999
...in history.

496
00:48:40,560 --> 00:48:43,399
I've been watching your base
for some time now.

497
00:48:44,320 --> 00:48:47,199
Your soldiers don't like to be here.

498
00:48:50,080 --> 00:48:53,599
Your army is facing poverty.

499
00:48:54,920 --> 00:48:58,199
Do you have the power
to do what you just said?

500
00:49:07,080 --> 00:49:10,759
You're going to give me that power today...

501
00:49:12,200 --> 00:49:16,519
...And I will return the
power to you tomorrow...

502
00:49:17,120 --> 00:49:20,959
...as in food, horses,
weapons and craftsmen

503
00:49:37,600 --> 00:49:41,639
Genghis rewarded the shepherd
who gave him a horse...

504
00:49:42,320 --> 00:49:45,199
...with a thousand horses in return.

505
00:49:45,400 --> 00:49:50,319
There's no one who can give you
what I'm offering.

506
00:49:57,400 --> 00:50:01,679
If Konya and the borderlands are not enough,
Lord Valens.

507
00:50:02,360 --> 00:50:05,399
If you aim for more...

508
00:50:06,400 --> 00:50:13,199
...when everything is over, I will give you an army,
so you can go for Constantinople.

509
00:50:16,080 --> 00:50:20,399
You will be Nayman Khan's friend,
Emperor Valens.

510
00:50:23,640 --> 00:50:28,639
Those who are washed in the blood
should sit on the thrones, Lord.

511
00:50:32,280 --> 00:50:36,719
I thought you were just a warrior, Nayman.

512
00:50:37,280 --> 00:50:41,799
But you are also a
skilled merchant of dreams.

513
00:50:44,720 --> 00:50:49,759
I am happy to be the one
that brings balance to these lands.

514
00:50:51,120 --> 00:50:53,599
But I will think about your offer.

515
00:50:54,560 --> 00:50:57,919
Think about it, Lord Valens.

516
00:50:58,200 --> 00:51:00,839
Give me your answer soon.

517
00:51:04,200 --> 00:51:09,999
I won't share my victory
in a battle I won alone.

518
00:51:19,200 --> 00:51:22,679
There is no victory in these lands
without me, Nayman.

519
00:51:25,360 --> 00:51:27,239
We will meet soon.

520
00:51:42,040 --> 00:51:46,319
Did you make your decision Bengi Hatun?
We are waiting for you to go to the trial.

521
00:51:47,360 --> 00:51:49,599
If I come to that trial..

522
00:51:50,200 --> 00:51:52,239
...Malhun will be sentenced to death.

523
00:51:53,680 --> 00:51:55,319
I am no good for you.

524
00:51:55,320 --> 00:52:00,159
Aunt Malhun is not someone
that would use Ismihan to kill Esma.

525
00:52:01,880 --> 00:52:06,559
If you don't speak,
they will kill aunt Malhun!

526
00:52:07,680 --> 00:52:10,319
You will either talk, or forget about us!

527
00:52:15,680 --> 00:52:17,199
I can't talk, my girl.

528
00:52:18,240 --> 00:52:20,279
For your safety, I can't talk.

529
00:52:34,120 --> 00:52:38,599
May peace and mercy of Allah be upon you.

530
00:52:47,600 --> 00:52:48,919
