in danger because of those Mongols.

798
01:18:21,600 --> 01:18:25,359
Mongols are destroying it from the outside
and you from the inside.

799
01:18:26,000 --> 01:18:28,239
You shouldn't have come to Konya.

800
01:18:29,000 --> 01:18:31,119
If you want to save your life...

801
01:18:31,120 --> 01:18:32,919
...leave Konya right away.

802
01:18:33,360 --> 01:18:35,999
If not,
you're going to die like a traitor.

803
01:18:36,000 --> 01:18:41,319
Let my life be sacrificed
for the future of Seljuk.

804
01:18:42,240 --> 01:18:45,599
One can die but the nation lives on.

805
01:18:48,400 --> 01:18:50,999
You commander Ertegin...

806
01:18:51,000 --> 01:18:52,919
..how many times did we fight?

807
01:18:52,920 --> 01:18:54,999
Unnumberable times!

808
01:18:55,600 --> 01:18:57,879
What about you Commander Sungur?

809
01:18:57,880 --> 01:18:59,519
Many times.

810
01:19:02,800 --> 01:19:07,759
We all fight with you for all of Seljuk Sultan.

811
01:19:07,760 --> 01:19:09,399
I know.

812
01:19:10,200 --> 01:19:12,799
That's why I gathered you here.

813
01:19:17,800 --> 01:19:20,319
What do you want from us?

814
01:19:21,280 --> 01:19:22,599
My sultan...

815
01:19:22,600 --> 01:19:24,599
...here.

816
01:19:25,800 --> 01:19:28,719
What are these names Osman Bey?

817
01:19:28,720 --> 01:19:31,439
There will be a fight soon.

818
01:19:31,440 --> 01:19:33,639
These are the names of the commanders.

819
01:19:34,000 --> 01:19:35,479
My sultan.

820
01:19:35,480 --> 01:19:37,639
When I go to war...

821
01:19:37,640 --> 01:19:40,039
...I don't want these commanders against me.

822
01:19:40,800 --> 01:19:43,799
While the Sultan who owns
the throne is ordering them...

823
01:19:43,920 --> 01:19:47,799
...who would listen to a Sultan
who was overthrown, Osman Bey?

824
01:19:47,800 --> 01:19:49,799
No my sultan.

825
01:19:49,800 --> 01:19:53,799
One of my best alps,
Konur will be with you.

826
01:19:53,800 --> 01:19:54,799
Don't worry.

827
01:19:54,800 --> 01:19:58,399
He went to war with
many of the commanders on this list.

828
01:20:00,200 --> 01:20:03,879
Of course, everyone has a tough mission.

829
01:20:03,880 --> 01:20:08,679
But if you stop a few
of the Mother Sultan's commanders...

830
01:20:08,680 --> 01:20:11,399
..the rest will follow the truth.

831
01:20:12,520 --> 01:20:15,599
We swung our swords
together at Konya for a while.

832
01:20:16,000 --> 01:20:18,279
You know me...

833
01:20:18,280 --> 01:20:19,999
...and I know you.

834
01:20:21,200 --> 01:20:24,119
It is now a fight between
the right and the wrong.

835
01:20:24,400 --> 01:20:27,819
Loyalty should only be shown
to the one who's following the truth.

836
01:20:28,120 --> 01:20:31,999
Sultan Alaeddin and Imsihan Sultan
are working with Nayman.

837
01:20:38,200 --> 01:20:40,319
How can a truthful man stand with them?

838
01:20:40,320 --> 01:20:42,559
Do you have proof Konur?

839
01:20:43,360 --> 01:20:46,199
Choose Sultan Mesut's
side before it's too late.

840
01:20:47,720 --> 01:20:50,559
Everything will be revealed
once he's on the throne.

841
01:20:54,600 --> 01:20:56,919
I want my throne back.

842
01:20:56,920 --> 01:20:58,359
My throne...

843
01:20:58,360 --> 01:21:02,999
...will be the savior of those being tortured
and the enemy of those who torture.

844
01:21:03,360 --> 01:21:05,279
All of Seljuk...

845
01:21:05,280 --> 01:21:08,919
...will have its old glory back.

846
01:21:08,920 --> 01:21:10,959
It will be rid of...

847
01:21:10,960 --> 01:21:12,599
...traitors.

848
01:21:12,600 --> 01:21:15,119
Mother Sultan would end us.

849
01:21:15,600 --> 01:21:18,119
That... That would mean the end for us.

850
01:21:19,080 --> 01:21:21,099
Those who feed their sword with hatred...

851
01:21:21,400 --> 01:21:25,309
...and those who say shahada in their last breath
will never end, commander Ertegin.

852
01:21:26,400 --> 01:21:27,759
Besides..

853
01:21:27,760 --> 01:21:29,879
...Osman Bey is with Sultan Mesut.

854
01:21:29,880 --> 01:21:31,199
Osman Bey?

855
01:21:31,200 --> 01:21:33,879
Yes you heard it right. Osman Bey.

856
01:21:36,280 --> 01:21:39,159
He's going to end this with Sultan Mesut.

857
01:21:39,600 --> 01:21:42,279
Tomorrow Osman Bey...

858
01:21:42,280 --> 01:21:44,879
...will plan the last parts...

859
01:21:44,880 --> 01:21:47,799
...of the plan near Cehennemdere.

860
01:21:50,000 --> 01:21:53,439
I want to see you with him.

861
01:21:55,120 --> 01:21:56,199
Beys.

862
01:21:56,200 --> 01:21:58,919
On one side the real owner
of the throne Sultan Mesut..

863
01:21:58,920 --> 01:22:00,199
...and Osman Bey...

864
01:22:01,000 --> 01:22:04,399
...and the other side Mother Sultan
who works with the enemy.

865
01:22:05,880 --> 01:22:07,759
Make your decision wisely.

866
01:22:42,600 --> 01:22:48,919
Instead of reporting my uncle Mesut's
treachery, why didn't you kill him?

867
01:22:51,280 --> 01:22:54,199
How did you let him be with his treachery?

868
01:22:54,520 --> 01:22:57,679
My Sultan we wanted to tell you first.

869
01:22:57,680 --> 01:22:58,599
He's your family.

870
01:22:59,000 --> 01:23:00,119
Shut up.

871
01:23:02,960 --> 01:23:06,239
I want that traitor dead.

872
01:23:07,960 --> 01:23:09,599
His lust for the throne..

873
01:23:09,600 --> 01:23:11,599
...will bring his end.

874
01:23:11,920 --> 01:23:14,319
Send soldiers out Vizier.

875
01:23:14,800 --> 01:23:16,599
We're going to find where he is.

876
01:23:16,600 --> 01:23:20,999
Until my uncle is found
everywhere will be searched.

877
01:23:21,000 --> 01:23:23,279
We will find Mesut.

878
01:23:23,560 --> 01:23:26,199
Arid bring you his head my Sultan.

879
01:23:26,920 --> 01:23:29,279
I won’t stop with his head.

880
01:23:29,280 --> 01:23:33,639
I'm going to hang his body in front of Konya
so that everyone learns a lesson.

881
01:23:33,640 --> 01:23:35,679
But not just him no.

882
01:23:35,880 --> 01:23:39,999
I'm going to rip the heart of that...

883
01:23:40,000 --> 01:23:42,709
...Osman who turns out to be behind everything.

884
01:23:44,560 --> 01:23:48,639
You’ll go to Cehennemdere
as if you've betrayed me.

885
01:23:50,320 --> 01:23:53,079
You're going to bring me Osman!

886
01:23:55,640 --> 01:23:59,599
I will personally take Oman’s life.

887
01:24:03,680 --> 01:24:06,399
Go on, get to work!

888
01:24:18,600 --> 01:24:22,559
You've reached for the throne that's mine...

889
01:24:24,320 --> 01:24:26,599
..and you shall pay.

890
01:24:27,640 --> 01:24:30,799
I will be your nightmare!

891
01:24:33,200 --> 01:24:35,079
Caravansarai.

892
01:24:36,720 --> 01:24:38,279
Oh, Bengi!

893
01:24:38,400 --> 01:24:41,119
You fool!

894
01:24:42,320 --> 01:24:45,719
She messed everything up.

895
01:24:47,080 --> 01:24:48,199
Everything!

896
01:24:48,520 --> 01:24:51,599
She went behind my back!

897
01:24:51,840 --> 01:24:54,959
But those who have crossed me..

898
01:24:55,240 --> 01:24:57,519
...crosses the State of Seljuk as well.

899
01:24:57,920 --> 01:24:59,639
Of course.

900
01:24:59,640 --> 01:25:02,119
We're at your service, Mother Sultan.

901
01:25:02,120 --> 01:25:04,639
Just give me the word and I'll kill her.

902
01:25:05,280 --> 01:25:07,039
You will kill her.

903
01:25:07,280 --> 01:25:08,399
You will.

904
01:25:08,920 --> 01:25:13,079
No fault against the State of Seljuk
goes unpunished...

905
01:25:13,480 --> 01:25:15,999
...but she can't get off that easy.

906
01:25:16,920 --> 01:25:19,239
That won't be the case.

907
01:25:19,800 --> 01:25:22,999
You're first going to make Bengi...

908
01:25:23,680 --> 01:25:25,439
...feel tremendous pain.

909
01:25:25,920 --> 01:25:27,999
You will kill Alcicek!

910
01:25:28,920 --> 01:25:30,599
Then..

911
01:25:31,640 --> 01:25:33,959
...you are going to kill Bengi.

912
01:25:34,520 --> 01:25:36,399
Before she dies...

913
01:25:36,920 --> 01:25:41,079
...I am going to make her experience
the greatest pain the world!

914
01:25:42,000 --> 01:25:44,159
As you command Mother Sultan.

915
01:25:45,360 --> 01:25:47,199
am going to kill both of them.

916
01:25:48,000 --> 01:25:49,759
Rest assured.

917
01:25:56,040 --> 01:26:00,559
I promised you power and unity.

918
01:26:01,360 --> 01:26:03,439
But you betrayed me!

919
01:26:05,080 --> 01:26:08,079
You will see what it means to...

920
01:26:08,360 --> 01:26:11,959
...betray me, Bengi Hatun!

921
01:26:15,440 --> 01:26:17,879
My Sultan, we got word
from Commander Ertegin.

922
01:26:36,560 --> 01:26:39,839
Sultan Mesud is here..

923
01:26:41,400 --> 01:26:43,119
...in Konya.

924
01:26:44,520 --> 01:26:49,399
He is meeting the commanders
with the support of Osman Bey.

925
01:26:51,920 --> 01:26:56,159
They are going to make the move...

926
01:26:57,000 --> 01:26:58,959
..that would dethrone Sultan Alaeddin!

927
01:27:13,400 --> 01:27:16,159
Send a messenger to Nayman.

928
01:27:17,000 --> 01:27:18,999
As you command, Mother Sultan.

929
01:27:25,040 --> 01:27:27,679
Bursa Palace.

930
01:27:28,360 --> 01:27:30,159
Nayman...

931
01:27:30,800 --> 01:27:32,879
...promised me Konya.

932
01:27:34,040 --> 01:27:38,799
He told me that I am the man
that would revive Byzantine.

933
01:27:39,160 --> 01:27:40,759
Is that possible?

934
01:27:42,080 --> 01:27:45,119
Konya has been under the shadow
of Mongolians for years!

935
01:27:47,560 --> 01:27:53,079
If we work together with Nayman
and fight against Gazan, and win the war...

936
01:27:54,240 --> 01:27:55,999
...Konya will be ours.

937
01:27:56,240 --> 01:28:01,719
We cannot put Byzantine into a battle like this
without asking Emperor Andronikos first.

938
01:28:05,080 --> 01:28:06,879
That was his other offer.

939
01:28:07,800 --> 01:28:13,279
When the battle is won, he told me that
I would sit on the throne of the empire.

940
01:28:14,400 --> 01:28:18,319
After Gazan, Andronikos is next.

941
01:28:19,000 --> 01:28:23,999
The council would want you to sit on the throne
more than anything, Lord Valens.

942
01:28:24,880 --> 01:28:27,359
It's a dangerous decision no matter what.

943
01:28:28,880 --> 01:28:30,759
We need to think carefully.

944
01:28:31,520 --> 01:28:34,839
Our decision will change
the fate of Byzantine.

945
01:28:35,000 --> 01:28:39,039
The enemy you know is better than
the one you don't know.

946
01:28:39,600 --> 01:28:44,159
We have known Osman for years,
we can guess what he might do.

947
01:28:44,840 --> 01:28:47,199
Osman is a simple man.

948
01:28:47,400 --> 01:28:50,479
To Nayman, on the other hand,
we cannot trust.

949
01:28:53,000 --> 01:28:54,799
Lord Valens!

950
01:28:57,160 --> 01:28:57,999
Come in.

951
01:29:02,680 --> 01:29:06,039
Sir, we got word from scouts.

952
01:29:06,280 --> 01:29:10,839
Osman met dethroned Sultan near Konya.

953
01:29:30,280 --> 01:29:35,559
Osman is going to dethrone Alaeddin
and enthrone Mesud.

954
01:29:40,280 --> 01:29:42,199
Did you guess that too?

955
01:29:49,720 --> 01:29:52,639
The soldiers that control this street,
which commander rules over them?

956
01:29:53,120 --> 01:29:58,199
My Bey, that street and the soldiers in this street
are under commander Ertegin's command.

957
01:30:01,000 --> 01:30:03,199
What about the city guards?

958
01:30:04,000 --> 01:30:06,919
My Bey, Sultan Mesud is coming.

959
01:30:07,520 --> 01:30:09,719
Let him come, come on.

960
01:30:10,440 --> 01:30:11,639
Peace be with you.

961
01:30:11,640 --> 01:30:13,719
Peace be upon you my Sultan.

962
01:30:13,720 --> 01:30:15,199
Welcome. Come.

963
01:30:15,200 --> 01:30:16,319
Thanks.

964
01:30:17,000 --> 01:30:17,879
Brother.

965
01:30:21,600 --> 01:30:22,799
I'll take it my Sultan.

966
01:30:24,360 --> 01:30:25,599
Come in y Sultan.

967
01:30:31,440 --> 01:30:34,359
Aykurt. Bring our Sultan food.

968
01:30:36,200 --> 01:30:37,399
My Sultan.

969
01:30:37,520 --> 01:30:39,879
InshAllah you have good news.

970
01:30:41,760 --> 01:30:45,559
I have both good and bad news Osman Bey.

971
01:30:49,800 --> 01:30:50,599
My Bey.

972
01:30:51,400 --> 01:30:54,279
Some commanders
decided to side with us.

973
01:30:55,520 --> 01:30:58,199
But almost half stayed with Mother Sultan.

974
01:31:01,400 --> 01:31:04,479
Mother Sultan gave them promises.

975
01:31:04,800 --> 01:31:07,679
But those who are oppressors...

976
01:31:08,120 --> 01:31:11,519
...will always lose against us.

977
01:31:11,720 --> 01:31:12,639
InshAllah my Bey.

978
01:31:14,360 --> 01:31:15,479
My Sultan.

979
01:31:15,600 --> 01:31:17,319
What about our other move?

980
01:31:17,320 --> 01:31:19,319
We did as you said Osman Bey.

981
01:31:19,520 --> 01:31:21,279
As Bayindir said...

982
01:31:22,320 --> 01:31:26,159
...the commanders who are loyal to Ismihan,
Ertegi and Sungur...

983
01:31:26,360 --> 01:31:31,519
...were told about the location you gave us.

984
01:31:33,880 --> 01:31:36,679
They'll attack us there.

985
01:31:37,520 --> 01:31:38,879
My Sultan.

986
01:31:39,080 --> 01:31:40,879
They'll tell her about you.

987
01:31:41,640 --> 01:31:43,639
It will be harder from now on.

988
01:31:44,200 --> 01:31:45,399
So be it.

989
01:31:46,800 --> 01:31:49,559
We're willing to die Osman Bey.

990
01:31:49,960 --> 01:31:51,279
My Sultan.

991
01:31:51,280 --> 01:31:53,199
This is the only way to win.

992
01:31:53,600 --> 01:31:55,399
Thank you.

993
01:31:58,400 --> 01:31:59,519
My Sultan.

994
01:32:00,240 --> 01:32:03,999
Only tough people can walk the tough paths.

995
01:32:04,400 --> 01:32:05,599
Eyvallah.

996
01:32:06,840 --> 01:32:08,279
Let's begin.

997
01:32:08,560 --> 01:32:10,359
You'll get back before nightfall.

998
01:32:11,040 --> 01:32:12,359
-Eyvallah.
-Go ahead.

999
01:32:12,480 --> 01:32:14,359
In the name of Allah.

1000
01:32:20,520 --> 01:32:23,799
Oktem's tribe

1001
01:32:49,400 --> 01:32:50,999
So dirty.

1002
01:32:51,600 --> 01:32:56,119
I can't get rid of this dirt.

1003
01:33:02,160 --> 01:33:04,119
It's not dirt, it's blood.

1004
01:33:07,520 --> 01:33:09,999
It's my blood on your hands.

1005
01:33:13,160 --> 01:33:16,319
You can’t wash away that blood.

1006
01:33:21,200 --> 01:33:22,239
Esma.

1007
01:33:22,680 --> 01:33:25,159
Esma forgive me.

1008
01:33:49,600 --> 01:33:51,839
Astagfirullah.

1009
01:33:52,520 --> 01:33:53,919
Astagfirullah.

1010
01:33:57,920 --> 01:34:00,079
Allah forgive me.

1011
01:34:14,000 --> 01:34:15,439
Here my Sultan.

1012
01:34:15,440 --> 01:34:17,239
This is a crossroads.

1013
01:34:18,200 --> 01:34:20,039
This is how the game begins.

1014
01:34:20,920 --> 01:34:25,919
Now, Ertegin and Sungur must be
on their way to attack us.

1015
01:34:27,320 --> 01:34:29,519
They'thirtk they'll ambush you my Bey.

1016
01:34:30,400 --> 01:34:34,839
Now, our loyal commanders,
Salancu and Korkmaz...

1017
01:34:34,840 --> 01:34:37,879
...will arrest us when we get to Konya.

1018
01:34:39,200 --> 01:34:40,999
It's our men that will arrest you.

1019
01:34:41,720 --> 01:34:44,759
But the attackers..

1020
01:34:44,760 --> 01:34:46,669
..are Ismihan's followers.

1021
01:34:47,280 --> 01:34:49,559
This is how this game works.

1022
01:34:49,560 --> 01:34:52,319
Ismihan's followers will leave Konya.

1023
01:34:52,720 --> 01:34:55,039
And we will go to Konya with the Alps.

1024
01:34:55,040 --> 01:34:57,039
And InshAllah you’ll own the throne.

1025
01:34:58,000 --> 01:35:03,039
Mogol took my throne to help the Turks.

1026
01:35:03,560 --> 01:35:08,119
Then they fooled Ismihan and
used my nephew Alaeddin.

1027
01:35:08,320 --> 01:35:13,079
The captivity at the skirts of Konya
will come to an end too now.

1028
01:35:13,080 --> 01:35:14,439
Osman Bey.

1029
01:35:14,640 --> 01:35:16,799
When I get on the throne...

1030
01:35:16,800 --> 01:35:19,239
..I'll be supporting your dreams.

1031
01:35:19,720 --> 01:35:20,799
EyvAllah.

1032
01:35:20,800 --> 01:35:23,199
InshAllah the next time we see you...

1033
01:35:23,200 --> 01:35:25,199
...you'll be throned my Sultan.

1034
01:35:26,040 --> 01:35:28,399
First chains on my arms..,

1035
01:35:28,400 --> 01:35:31,479
..then the kaftan of sultanate on my back..

1036
01:35:32,880 --> 01:35:34,319
But...

1037
01:35:34,320 --> 01:35:38,119
...is the number of those commanders loyal to us enough?

1038
01:35:38,120 --> 01:35:40,679
There might be more in there.

1039
01:35:44,920 --> 01:35:46,599
Don't worry>

1040
01:35:46,600 --> 01:35:48,559
Once the swords are drawn..

1041
01:35:48,560 --> 01:35:51,079
...me and my alps will be with you.

1042
01:35:51,080 --> 01:35:53,559
We're going to get you on that throne.

1043
01:35:53,560 --> 01:35:54,999
Eyvallah.

1044
01:35:55,000 --> 01:35:56,679
Good luck to you.

1045
01:35:56,680 --> 01:35:59,319
Good luck to you too.

1046
01:35:59,320 --> 01:36:01,319
Be careful on the way.

1047
01:36:12,680 --> 01:36:15,679
Nayman's Base

1048
01:36:41,520 --> 01:36:45,799
We're going to go into the headquarters
with Mongolian clothes.

1049
01:36:45,920 --> 01:36:48,389
We'll enter the den of jackals
in their hide.

1050
01:36:51,520 --> 01:36:53,479
What will be Cerkutay's move?

1051
01:36:53,480 --> 01:36:55,519
We'll interfere within them.

1052
01:36:55,520 --> 01:36:57,799
Cerkutay will blow up the ammunition...

1053
01:36:57,800 --> 01:36:59,559
...and create chaos.

1054
01:36:59,560 --> 01:37:02,599
When the warriors go towards there...

1055
01:37:02,920 --> 01:37:05,759
...we're going to take the carriages out, huh?

1056
01:37:13,200 --> 01:37:15,679
You'll be able to handle it right?

1057
01:37:15,680 --> 01:37:17,279
Do your own work.

1058
01:37:18,200 --> 01:37:19,599
Come on.

1059
01:37:26,960 --> 01:37:29,839
Commander Nayman, Ismihan has sent this.

1060
01:37:41,840 --> 01:37:43,239
Osman.

1061
01:37:46,080 --> 01:37:50,199
Osman will weaken Ismihan.

1062
01:39:54,640 --> 01:39:57,399
The horses are running away.

1063
01:39:57,400 --> 01:40:00,639
-Horses are running away.. Quick!
-Bring water.

1064
01:40:00,640 --> 01:40:02,599
Come on. Come on.

1065
01:40:02,600 --> 01:40:04,799
-Run! Run!
-They're running.

1066
01:40:08,520 --> 01:40:10,479
It's coming this way come on.

1067
01:40:10,480 --> 01:40:12,719
Be quick. Come on.

1068
01:40:13,600 --> 01:40:15,519
Come on. Come on.

1069
01:40:15,760 --> 01:40:17,639
-Brother...
-Hurry up!

1070
01:40:18,160 --> 01:40:19,079
...let's go.

1071
01:40:19,800 --> 01:40:21,639
Hurry up!

1072
01:40:21,920 --> 01:40:22,879
Watch out!

1073
01:40:23,080 --> 01:40:23,559
Come on!

1074
01:40:23,880 --> 01:40:25,399
Hurry up, everyone!

1075
01:40:26,280 --> 01:40:28,039
Let's go, brother.

1076
01:40:30,480 --> 01:40:31,719
Bring more water here?

1077
01:40:32,680 --> 01:40:34,359
Let's go, brothers.

1078
01:40:34,920 --> 01:40:38,519
They're taking the catapults!

1079
01:40:39,320 --> 01:40:40,479
Gurbuz!

1080
01:40:41,120 --> 01:40:42,879
Where's Gurbuz, brother?

1081
01:40:45,640 --> 01:40:46,359
Gurbuz!

1082
01:40:46,760 --> 01:40:47,599
Gurbuz!

1083
01:40:49,040 --> 01:40:50,959
Run, brother!

1084
01:40:53,240 --> 01:40:55,919
Take my hand, brother!

1085
01:41:00,800 --> 01:41:02,159
Brother!

1086
01:41:09,200 --> 01:41:11,999
Stop them!

1087
01:41:16,200 --> 01:41:17,439
Come on, brother!

1088
01:41:17,960 --> 01:41:19,159
Come on!

1089
01:41:19,400 --> 01:41:20,639
Brother!

1090
01:41:20,880 --> 01:41:22,679
Shoot him!

1091
01:41:23,480 --> 01:41:24,319
Come on-

1092
01:41:24,600 --> 01:41:28,239
Brother!

1093
01:41:38,240 --> 01:41:40,239
Stop the carriage!

1094
01:41:43,880 --> 01:41:45,199
Leave me.

1095
01:41:48,000 --> 01:41:50,199
Leave me and take the catapults.

1096
01:41:50,400 --> 01:41:53,679
Hang in there!

1097
01:41:53,800 --> 01:41:54,799
Let's go.

1098
01:41:56,800 --> 01:41:58,279
Let's go!

1099
01:42:02,400 --> 01:42:03,879
We're leaving, brother!

1100
01:42:06,280 --> 01:42:09,359
Shoot the mighty arrows of the Turks, my lions!

1101
01:42:09,360 --> 01:42:11,839
Bring order with your bows!

1102
01:42:12,960 --> 01:42:13,759
Oh, Haqq!

1103
01:42:15,000 --> 01:42:16,119
Alright, Gurbuz.

1104
01:42:39,400 --> 01:42:41,279
You did the right thing.

1105
01:42:42,040 --> 01:42:44,239
But I stumbled upon many wrong paths...

1106
01:42:46,080 --> 01:42:48,639
...until I found the right one.

1107
01:42:50,280 --> 01:42:53,799
I even have my own family's
blood on my hands.

1108
01:42:54,360 --> 01:42:57,399
Don't blame yourself for Esma’s death.

1109
01:42:59,000 --> 01:43:02,239
You didn’t know Ismihan
could have gone that far.

1110
01:43:03,240 --> 01:43:07,119
I'm afraid she'll go even further now.

1111
01:43:09,160 --> 01:43:11,999
She threatened me with Alcicek's life.

1112
01:43:12,720 --> 01:43:16,719
Don't let Alcicek leave
your sight, Aktemur.

1113
01:43:17,120 --> 01:43:19,759
Don't worry, mother. Trust m

1114
01:43:20,440 --> 01:43:24,639
I will protect Alcicek
and our tribe with my life.

1115
01:43:35,080 --> 01:43:36,999
What's going on here?

1116
01:43:38,640 --> 01:43:41,479
What are you two whispering about?

1117
01:43:42,880 --> 01:43:44,519
Is there a problem?

1118
01:43:44,920 --> 01:43:46,079
There's no problem.

1119
01:43:48,520 --> 01:43:51,359
I just needed Aktemur Bey's
opinion on some issues.

1120
01:44:37,200 --> 01:44:39,519
Hang in there...brother.
Hang in there.

1121
01:44:39,760 --> 01:44:40,879
We're almost there.

1122
01:44:41,040 --> 01:44:42,999
We're about to get to Yenisehir!

1123
01:44:43,560 --> 01:44:45,959
Go faster!

1124
01:44:46,080 --> 01:44:47,759
Hurry up!

1125
01:44:59,880 --> 01:45:00,799
Hang in there.

1126
01:45:01,560 --> 01:45:04,719
We'll get to Yenisehir and you'll be fine.

1127
01:45:05,200 --> 01:45:06,599
Faster!

1128
01:45:07,000 --> 01:45:09,919
The doctors there will help you,
hang in there!

1129
01:45:10,400 --> 01:45:11,919
Hang in there, brother!

1130
01:45:12,080 --> 01:45:14,599
Hang in there!

1131
01:45:16,600 --> 01:45:17,999
On my mark!

1132
01:45:18,000 --> 01:45:20,399
One, two, three!

1133
01:45:21,120 --> 01:45:22,879
-Alright.
-Faster!

1134
01:45:23,280 --> 01:45:24,239
Hang in there.

1135
01:45:25,000 --> 01:45:27,879
Hold on! Look at me!

1136
01:45:27,880 --> 01:45:29,839
You are okay!

1137
01:45:30,480 --> 01:45:32,279
You are okay! You will be okay!

1138
01:45:32,280 --> 01:45:33,999
Come on!

1139
01:45:39,400 --> 01:45:42,399
Faster!

1140
01:45:45,080 --> 01:45:48,399
Brother! Faster!

1141
01:45:48,400 --> 01:45:52,519
You are going to eat all the food by yourself, Gurbuz.

1142
01:45:52,520 --> 01:45:55,359
You are going to eat all the food by yourself.

1143
01:45:56,320 --> 01:45:59,199
Faster! Come on!

1144
01:46:11,080 --> 01:46:14,559
When we kill Osman,
Mother Sultan will make us very rich.

1145
01:46:17,400 --> 01:46:21,279
How richer can Mother Sultan
make you Commander Ertegin?

1146
01:46:22,000 --> 01:46:24,719
Ertegi’s loyalty is expensive.

1147
01:46:24,880 --> 01:46:29,999
Well, you are not cheap either,
we love money too. Let's go take Osman.

1148
01:46:47,720 --> 01:46:50,199
Commander Salancu,
we found Mesut's location.

1149
01:46:52,760 --> 01:46:55,559
We entered the house our eyes closed,
how did you find it?

1150
01:46:55,640 --> 01:46:58,039
We told them about what we heard.

1151
01:46:58,240 --> 01:47:00,959
With the skill of our soldiers,
it was not hard.

1152
01:47:00,960 --> 01:47:03,119
You are a good commander.

1153
01:47:04,880 --> 01:47:09,759
Then you will take Mesud, and we will take Osman.
Today, blood will be spilled in Konya.

1154
01:47:10,360 --> 01:47:13,999
The blood to be spilled
will make us rich.

1155
01:47:22,040 --> 01:47:26,239
The coin brought by blood
will only take you to hell.

1156
01:47:43,800 --> 01:47:45,159
Bengi Hatun.

1157
01:47:48,600 --> 01:47:50,239
Welcome.

1158
01:47:52,000 --> 01:47:54,519
Why are you here, Mother Ayse?

1159
01:47:54,720 --> 01:47:56,199
For our duty.

1160
01:48:05,200 --> 01:48:07,799
We will take Bengi Hatun to trial.

1161
01:48:12,360 --> 01:48:14,199
I was waiting for you.

1162
01:48:14,880 --> 01:48:16,279
Come on, let's go.

1163
01:48:17,200 --> 01:48:19,479
What are you saying, aunt Malhun?

1164
01:48:19,800 --> 01:48:24,199
My mother risked her life and
told everything that Ismihan Sultan did.

1165
01:48:27,320 --> 01:48:30,959
Instead of thanking me,
are you going to punish me?

1166
01:48:33,400 --> 01:48:34,799
We are grateful.

1167
01:48:35,400 --> 01:48:37,399
She helped us.

1168
01:48:39,240 --> 01:48:44,239
But her confession does not redeem her crimes.

1169
01:48:47,400 --> 01:48:48,279
No.

1170
01:48:49,000 --> 01:48:50,399
I won't let you.

1171
01:48:51,000 --> 01:48:53,199
I just have my mother left.

1172
01:48:55,120 --> 01:48:58,559
We will go far away if necessary,
but I won’t let her go.

1173
01:49:02,400 --> 01:49:03,759
Alcicek.

1174
01:49:05,080 --> 01:49:06,839
It's just a trial.

1175
01:49:06,960 --> 01:49:10,679
If my mother goes, I will not forgive you.

1176
01:49:15,960 --> 01:49:17,399
Alcicek.

1177
01:49:18,880 --> 01:49:23,199
You are being an obstacle to the justice.
Don’t do this, my girl.

1178
01:49:34,800 --> 01:49:38,359
I know what I did,
and the punishment for it.

1179
01:49:41,120 --> 01:49:42,519
Now move.

1180
01:49:43,600 --> 01:49:45,679
Let it happen, okay?

1181
01:49:52,400 --> 01:49:54,199
There is no need for that.

1182
01:50:07,800 --> 01:50:08,919
Here.

1183
01:50:10,640 --> 01:50:12,479
This is yours now.

1184
01:50:28,280 --> 01:50:30,199
May Allah protect you.

1185
01:50:34,080 --> 01:50:35,719
Take care of each other.

1186
01:50:38,920 --> 01:50:40,039
Be careful.

1187
01:50:44,400 --> 01:50:45,799
Don't worry.

1188
01:50:47,240 --> 01:50:49,159
We'll protect Alcicek.

1189
01:50:49,880 --> 01:50:51,399
Thanks Ayse Hatun.

1190
01:50:57,440 --> 01:50:58,319
Come on.

1191
01:51:30,120 --> 01:51:30,999
Come on.

1192
01:51:57,120 --> 01:51:58,799
Come here. Come here.

1193
01:52:30,720 --> 01:52:35,119
You thought we'd betray Mother Sultan, Osman Bey?

1194
01:52:39,800 --> 01:52:42,079
We're only loyal to Mother Sultan.

1195
01:52:42,520 --> 01:52:44,639
She gave us this power.

1196
01:52:45,680 --> 01:52:47,879
Mother Sultan's followers..

1197
01:52:49,800 --> 01:52:51,319
...are betraying the state.

1198
01:52:53,720 --> 01:52:55,199
Mother Sultan..

1199
01:52:55,400 --> 01:52:58,599
...knows nothing but herself and her power.

1200
01:52:59,800 --> 01:53:00,999
Now...

1201
01:53:01,760 --> 01:53:04,239
...you can choose the right side.

1202
01:53:05,160 --> 01:53:07,319
The only owner of the throne...

1203
01:53:08,200 --> 01:53:10,319
..is Sultan Mesut.

1204
01:53:10,320 --> 01:53:13,959
You think you can get away with it Osman Bey?

1205
01:53:14,240 --> 01:53:16,959
This is your last rebellion.

1206
01:53:18,000 --> 01:53:20,239
Now we'll take you
to Mother Sultan...

1207
01:53:20,920 --> 01:53:22,959
..and increase .our gold.

1208
01:53:35,080 --> 01:53:38,319
Great Seljuk's powerful commanders!

1209
01:53:39,800 --> 01:53:40,639
Foolishness..

1210
01:53:41,800 --> 01:53:43,359
...is a deep pit.

1211
01:53:44,080 --> 01:53:45,879
I know it well.

1212
01:53:47,200 --> 01:53:48,439
When you fall..

1213
01:53:49,680 --> 01:53:51,599
...it's hard to get out.

1214
01:53:55,920 --> 01:53:58,159
We're trying to help you, friends.

1215
01:53:59,640 --> 01:54:00,679
Don't do it.

1216
01:54:03,240 --> 01:54:04,559
Don't be blinded.

1217
01:54:07,200 --> 01:54:08,799
Choose the right side.

1218
01:54:09,360 --> 01:54:11,839
So, you’re a part of the treason Bayindir Bey.

1219
01:54:11,840 --> 01:54:13,239
No.

1220
01:54:13,880 --> 01:54:15,799
Alhamdulillah.

1221
01:54:19,560 --> 01:54:21,319
...have chosen the right side.

1222
01:54:26,160 --> 01:54:28,119
You trapped us Osman Bey.

1223
01:54:28,400 --> 01:54:30,079
This only proves you're a traitor.

1224
01:54:30,400 --> 01:54:32,319
We know where Konur and Mesut are.

1225
01:54:33,720 --> 01:54:35,079
They're dead.

1226
01:54:36,000 --> 01:54:37,399
Is that so?

1227
01:54:38,400 --> 01:54:39,159
Come on th

1228
01:54:39,240 --> 01:54:40,159
Attack!

1229
01:55:11,480 --> 01:55:14,159
Mother Sultan's commanders
are going to Osman now.

1230
01:55:15,400 --> 01:55:17,999
Can we trust the ones in here Sultan Hadrath?

1231
01:55:19,360 --> 01:55:22,199
We can't trust anyone now.

1232
01:55:22,440 --> 01:55:24,399
They can change sides.

1233
01:55:24,400 --> 01:55:27,159
Your life must be worth a lot Sultan Hadrath.

1234
01:55:27,400 --> 01:55:29,759
No one's coin was enough until now.

1235
01:55:30,120 --> 01:55:32,639
Let's see whom destiny has in store for us.

1236
01:55:32,880 --> 01:55:34,079
At least..

1237
01:55:34,120 --> 01:55:36,879
...our side and fight are clear.

1238
01:55:36,880 --> 01:55:38,639
EyvAllah.

1239
01:55:39,800 --> 01:55:41,239
But know this..

1240
01:55:41,800 --> 01:55:45,319
...if someone's going to die,
it will be me first.

1241
01:55:45,600 --> 01:55:48,839
You won't fall before I do.

1242
01:55:49,360 --> 01:55:50,919
Eyvallah.

1243
01:56:05,760 --> 01:56:08,199
The traitor Mesut..

1244
01:56:08,200 --> 01:56:10,319
...and his helper Konur.

1245
01:56:10,320 --> 01:56:12,239
You're under arrest. Take them.

1246
01:57:10,000 --> 01:57:11,799
Now..

1247
01:57:12,600 --> 01:57:17,199
..you think you tricked us is that so?

1248
01:57:19,600 --> 01:57:25,999
But from the very start we knew
you were loyal to Mother Sultan.

1249
01:57:27,440 --> 01:57:29,079
If there's..

1250
01:57:30,720 --> 01:57:33,199
...someone who will set up a trap...

1251
01:57:34,080 --> 01:57:36,399
...then it's just us.

1252
01:57:37,000 --> 01:57:39,999
Mother Sultan will make you pay for this.

1253
01:57:40,600 --> 01:57:43,839
Mesut and Konur must be dead already, Osman.

1254
01:57:43,840 --> 01:57:45,679
What difference our deaths will make?

1255
01:57:45,679 --> 01:57:48,719
Do you know why I called you here?

1256
01:57:48,720 --> 01:57:50,119
Why?

1257
01:57:51,560 --> 01:57:53,399
There is..

1258
01:57:53,400 --> 01:57:56,559
...no commander left in Konya
who is loyal to...

1259
01:57:57,200 --> 01:57:58,479
...Ismihan Sultan.

1260
01:58:01,400 --> 01:58:03,319
The commanders who are in Konya..

1261
01:58:03,320 --> 01:58:06,759
...are just loyal to Sultan Mesut.

1262
01:58:09,920 --> 01:58:14,839
...by coming here from Konya
you left Mother Sultan alone.

1263
01:58:19,200 --> 01:58:20,559
Bayindir.

1264
01:58:21,600 --> 01:58:24,839
Take them to the cave with Huseyin.

1265
01:58:25,800 --> 01:58:30,319
After Sultan Mesut sits on the throne
he will decide what will happen to them.

1266
01:58:31,200 --> 01:58:32,919
As you wish my bey.

1267
01:58:38,280 --> 01:58:40,799
Go to Mother Sultan.

1268
01:58:41,160 --> 01:58:42,799
Continue your duty.

1269
01:58:42,800 --> 01:58:44,279
Yes.

1270
01:58:44,720 --> 01:58:46,239
Move.

1271
01:59:14,160 --> 01:59:15,559
What happened?

1272
01:59:17,320 --> 01:59:18,959
What is her punishment?

1273
01:59:19,200 --> 01:59:20,039
Aunt in law?

1274
01:59:23,600 --> 01:59:24,879
Mother?

1275
01:59:27,120 --> 01:59:29,359
Judge...

1276
01:59:33,320 --> 01:59:36,999
...has given Bengi Hatun two years in exile.

1277
01:59:41,240 --> 01:59:44,479
She will be staying in the dungeon until she leaves.

1278
01:59:45,480 --> 01:59:46,239
Mother.

1279
01:59:51,280 --> 01:59:53,119
Girl.

1280
01:59:53,400 --> 01:59:55,119
Don t cry.

1281
01:59:56,600 --> 01:59:59,559
Don t cry my beautiful girl.

1282
02:00:01,400 --> 02:00:03,119
My beautiful girl.

1283
02:00:08,920 --> 02:00:11,079
Don't be mad at me.

1284
02:00:11,160 --> 02:00:12,199
Come on.

1285
02:00:12,200 --> 02:00:13,879
-Come on.
-Alcicek.

1286
02:00:36,800 --> 02:00:38,599
My Sultan...

1287
02:00:38,800 --> 02:00:43,439
...here are the traitors who laid eyes
on your throne and planned bloody moves.

1288
02:00:52,160 --> 02:00:56,399
Your traitor uncle Mesud and Osman’s Alp Konur.

1289
02:01:00,320 --> 02:01:01,559
Uncle..

1290
02:01:13,280 --> 02:01:16,399
...why did you do this to me?

1291
02:01:20,440 --> 02:01:23,199
I always wanted you to live.

1292
02:01:26,120 --> 02:01:29,079
I had nothing against you.

1293
02:01:29,400 --> 02:01:32,879
My only concern has always been
the longevity of our State.

1294
02:01:48,800 --> 02:01:52,399
Do you see the situation, mother?

1295
02:02:05,640 --> 02:02:08,199
I do, Hadrat Sultan.

1296
02:02:09,320 --> 02:02:11,119
I do.

1297
02:02:15,680 --> 02:02:19,999
I had brought...

1298
02:02:21,520 --> 02:02:24,719
...my personal guards here...

1299
02:02:25,640 --> 02:02:28,799
..in case traitor Osman and...

1300
02:02:29,440 --> 02:02:33,959
...Mesud, who has eyes on your throne,
would do something.

1301
02:02:36,840 --> 02:02:41,759
But it seems the guards weren't necessary.

1302
02:02:47,520 --> 02:02:49,919
Mesut...

1303
02:02:50,200 --> 02:02:54,599
Instead of waiting for a peaceful death in your cell...

1304
02:02:55,400 --> 02:02:59,599
...you allowed Osman to use you in his plans.

1305
02:03:04,600 --> 02:03:09,159
You've damaged the State of Seljuk!

1306
02:03:12,880 --> 02:03:14,799
You..

1307
02:03:18,560 --> 02:03:23,839
Do you think working with Nayman...

1308
02:03:24,280 --> 02:03:28,279
...and going against the Turks
and Islam benefits the State?

1309
02:03:31,760 --> 02:03:33,519
What about you, Alaeddin?

1310
02:03:33,920 --> 02:03:35,639
Do you think that..

1311
02:03:35,800 --> 02:03:39,919
...letting your mother always control you
is the way to be the Sultan?

1312
02:03:45,120 --> 02:03:48,999
You are collaborating with Mongolians,
the people...

1313
02:03:49,440 --> 02:03:53,319
...whom we fought for centuries to stay free!

1314
02:03:53,920 --> 02:03:55,999
But why?

1315
02:03:56,400 --> 02:03:58,119
Why do you think?

1316
02:03:58,440 --> 02:04:01,799
It's because of their hatred towards Osman Bey.

1317
02:04:10,120 --> 02:04:12,519
Your Osman Bey...

1318
02:04:12,720 --> 02:04:16,199
...does not even deserve our hate!

1319
02:04:18,720 --> 02:04:20,599
Look at what you’ve done!

1320
02:04:20,880 --> 02:04:23,919
Look at what you’ve caused!

1321
02:04:31,960 --> 02:04:35,199
Your anger blinded you in such a way that
you work with our enemy.

1322
02:04:36,120 --> 02:04:38,359
How many valiants did Nayman kill?

1323
02:04:38,640 --> 02:04:40,879
-Enough!
-Mother Sultan.

1324
02:04:44,120 --> 02:04:46,879
There's someone who wants to see you.

1325
02:05:36,640 --> 02:05:38,599
Mother Sultan.

1326
02:05:38,800 --> 02:05:44,159
We’ve identified all the places
where Osman might be hiding at in Konya

1327
02:05:45,800 --> 02:05:48,399
Each are toeing watched.

1328
02:05:48,840 --> 02:05:50,479
I'm waiting to hear from them.

1329
02:05:50,600 --> 02:05:52,559
So don't worry.

1330
02:05:52,960 --> 02:05:56,199
I will bring him to you
as soon as possible.

1331
02:05:59,880 --> 02:06:03,839
Find them immediately, Bayindir.

1332
02:06:04,800 --> 02:06:09,279
They will continue to breathe until then.

1333
02:06:09,400 --> 02:06:10,919
Can I come in?

1334
02:06:11,680 --> 02:06:13,319
Come in.

1335
02:06:16,400 --> 02:06:18,999
Mother Sultan, my Bey.

1336
02:06:19,600 --> 02:06:21,519
We found Osman.

1337
02:06:24,040 --> 02:06:28,159
Mother Sultan Hadrath, allow me to..

1338
02:06:28,600 --> 02:06:32,759
...bring that last traitor to you.

1339
02:06:33,600 --> 02:06:37,439
If you come empty handed, Bayindir...

1340
02:06:38,400 --> 02:06:41,399
...I am going to put you in prison with them.

1341
02:06:41,400 --> 02:06:44,639
I am going to hang them all in Konya square.

1342
02:06:45,800 --> 02:06:49,519
No one will be able to..

1343
02:06:49,840 --> 02:06:52,519
...think about rebelling.

1344
02:06:54,000 --> 02:06:56,119
Be quick Bayind

1345
02:06:56,800 --> 02:07:00,959
Every breath they take harms us.

1346
02:07:15,160 --> 02:07:18,079
Cavundur's Bayindir.

1347
02:07:18,760 --> 02:07:21,479
Try to trick me...

1348
02:07:22,000 --> 02:07:25,199
...and I will make you experience
the greatest of pains!

1349
02:07:26,720 --> 02:07:28,679
Alps! Bring a stretcher!

1350
02:07:28,680 --> 02:07:31,399
Kumral Abdal! Kara Ebe!

1351
02:07:31,920 --> 02:07:33,199
Cerkutay?

1352
02:07:33,560 --> 02:07:34,919
What happened?

1353
02:07:36,960 --> 02:07:37,999
Gurbuz Alp!

1354
02:07:38,000 --> 02:07:41,919
Alps! Find Kumral Abdal quickly!

1355
02:07:42,160 --> 02:07:46,319
Kara Ebe! Kara Ebe!

1356
02:07:46,800 --> 02:07:49,799
Kara Ebe!

1357
02:07:49,960 --> 02:07:52,999
Help! My brother is dying!

1358
02:07:56,200 --> 02:07:57,039
Slowly.

1359
02:07:57,360 --> 02:08:00,359
His wound looks deep,
carry him inside quickly.

1360
02:08:00,480 --> 02:08:02,199
We need to cauterize the wound.

1361
02:08:02,440 --> 02:08:03,839
Allah protect him!

1362
02:08:03,840 --> 02:08:04,559
Oh Allah protect him

1363
02:08:06,800 --> 02:08:08,319
You are okay brother.

1364
02:08:08,480 --> 02:08:09,399
Inside! Quickly!

1365
02:08:09,440 --> 02:08:12,199
-You will be okay!
-Stop Cerkutay.

1366
02:08:12,760 --> 02:08:13,839
Stop.

1367
02:08:13,840 --> 02:08:16,039
My time has come

1368
02:08:17,440 --> 02:08:20,159
No! No!

1369
02:08:20,600 --> 02:08:24,039
No, no!

1370
02:08:26,360 --> 02:08:28,559
Give me your blessing.

1371
02:08:28,840 --> 02:08:33,599
No! You are going to eat more food with me!

1372
02:08:34,200 --> 02:08:36,199
Not now, brother.

1373
02:08:38,800 --> 02:08:43,109
I bear witness that there's none
worthy of worship except Allah...

1374
02:08:43,600 --> 02:08:50,999
...and I also bear witness that Mohammad
is His servant and messenger.

1375
02:08:52,000 --> 02:08:52,999
Am I dead?

1376
02:08:55,000 --> 02:08:57,399
Wait.

1377
02:08:58,200 --> 02:09:01,079
It's time for the questioning.

1378
02:09:02,600 --> 02:09:05,919
I am really dead, the questioning has begun.

1379
02:09:06,200 --> 02:09:08,199
Tell me, Gurbuz.

1380
02:09:09,800 --> 02:09:11,599
Who is your Lord?

1381
02:09:14,800 --> 02:09:17,519
Oh Allah, help me.

1382
02:09:18,680 --> 02:09:20,599
Great Allah.

1383
02:09:20,600 --> 02:09:22,919
Brother Gurbuz..

1384
02:09:24,520 --> 02:09:26,279
...what's your religion?

1385
02:09:26,680 --> 02:09:30,799
My religion is Islam.

1386
02:09:32,920 --> 02:09:34,599
I am sorry.

1387
02:09:35,040 --> 02:09:37,359
You look familiar.

1388
02:09:39,160 --> 02:09:41,639
And I don’t feel dead.

1389
02:09:42,400 --> 02:09:44,399
Is this how dead people see others?

1390
02:09:45,880 --> 02:09:48,679
This is just a disguise.

1391
02:09:49,400 --> 02:09:56,519
Now, you are going to answer
for the apples you stole from Cerkutay.

1392
02:09:57,920 --> 02:09:58,999
Apples?

1393
02:09:59,720 --> 02:10:01,799
Apples? What apples?

1394
02:10:02,920 --> 02:10:04,919
Cerkutay gave me his blessing.

1395
02:10:06,560 --> 02:10:07,639
Did he not?

1396
02:10:07,640 --> 02:10:08,919
Let me check.

1397
02:10:09,760 --> 02:10:13,079
It's written here.

1398
02:10:13,800 --> 02:10:15,719
He did not.

1399
02:10:18,120 --> 02:10:21,799
The apple is the cause? Am I going to hell?

1400
02:10:22,240 --> 02:10:23,639
Gurbuz Alp.

1401
02:10:26,480 --> 02:10:30,599
You should have thought about
that before eating haram food.

1402
02:10:32,880 --> 02:10:36,599
Cerkutay, just for an apple?

1403
02:10:37,000 --> 02:10:38,519
You ruined me!

1404
02:10:43,280 --> 02:10:50,199
May the apples you ate be halal for you,
I will give you the whole tree if you want brother.

1405
02:10:50,200 --> 02:10:52,399
Come on get up.

1406
02:10:53,760 --> 02:10:55,159
Am I dead?

1407
02:10:56,480 --> 02:10:57,959
Am I alive?

1408
02:10:58,600 --> 02:10:59,599
You did not die.

1409
02:11:01,400 --> 02:11:02,719
Cerkutay.

1410
02:11:04,680 --> 02:11:06,639
I'll kill you.

1411
02:11:11,000 --> 02:11:14,279
You will. You will. Just lie down.

1412
02:11:14,400 --> 02:11:17,399
Get some rest and get better.

1413
02:11:17,960 --> 02:11:20,679
Take this and go to bed.

1414
02:11:20,800 --> 02:11:22,679
Then you can kill me.

1415
02:11:23,720 --> 02:11:25,319
This is good.

1416
02:11:25,320 --> 02:11:28,079
Get some rest. Come on brother.

1417
02:11:28,200 --> 02:11:30,039
Let's get back to duty.

1418
02:11:31,880 --> 02:11:33,479
In the name of Allah.

1419
02:11:39,680 --> 02:11:40,999
I didn't die.

1420
02:11:49,800 --> 02:11:51,639
They'll be here soon.

1421
02:11:53,240 --> 02:11:54,149
Huseyin.

1422
02:11:55,000 --> 02:11:57,519
Did you do as I said?

1423
02:11:57,800 --> 02:11:58,959
We did my Bey.

1424
02:11:58,960 --> 02:12:00,159
Good.

1425
02:12:00,160 --> 02:12:02,919
Allah forbid...

1426
02:12:02,920 --> 02:12:04,919
I don't want any mistakes.

1427
02:12:12,760 --> 02:12:13,759
They're here.

1428
02:12:20,960 --> 02:12:21,799
My Bey.

1429
02:12:25,280 --> 02:12:27,839
Everything’s ready as you said.

1430
02:12:28,960 --> 02:12:30,559
But...

1431
02:12:35,600 --> 02:12:36,799
Ismihan.

1432
02:12:38,080 --> 02:12:42,599
She found a unit full of the best soldiers of Seljuk.

1433
02:12:44,120 --> 02:12:48,119
This unit is waiting by the Sultan.

1434
02:12:49,600 --> 02:12:50,719
They're waiting'for us.

1435
02:12:54,240 --> 02:12:57,639
What about Sultan Mesut and Konur? Ar

1436
02:12:58,800 --> 02:13:01,799
They're okay for now. But my Bey...

1437
02:13:02,320 --> 02:13:04,839
When I told them I had you..

1438
02:13:05,640 --> 02:13:09,919
...Ismihan said she would kill them
in the city center.

1439
02:13:10,600 --> 02:13:11,759
They're waiting for us.

1440
02:13:14,000 --> 02:13:16,599
Then when I go to Ismihan..

1441
02:13:16,720 --> 02:13:18,599
...it will be a tough fight.

1442
02:13:22,720 --> 02:13:23,999
Are you afraid?

1443
02:13:24,000 --> 02:13:25,199
No my Bey.

1444
02:13:25,360 --> 02:13:26,679
AstagfiruIlah.

1445
02:13:27,240 --> 02:13:31,439
My only fear is to choose the wrong side.

1446
02:13:31,800 --> 02:13:33,599
I'm willing to die for the right one.

1447
02:13:36,920 --> 02:13:38,279
Eyvallah.

1448
02:13:39,280 --> 02:13:41,199
Come on. Give the Alps the clothes.

1449
02:13:45,160 --> 02:13:46,799
Tie up our hands.

1450
02:13:52,800 --> 02:13:53,759
Here.

1451
02:13:55,000 --> 02:13:56,079
In the name of Allah.

1452
02:13:59,000 --> 02:13:59,999
Here.

1453
02:14:36,920 --> 02:14:37,999
What a shame.

1454
02:14:40,240 --> 02:14:42,919
You used to

1455
02:14:43,600 --> 02:14:45,319
Now you're waiting to die here.

1456
02:14:47,360 --> 02:14:50,799
You used to rule this city.

1457
02:14:51,880 --> 02:14:53,119
Now you'll die here.

1458
02:14:54,120 --> 02:14:55,159
Mesut.

1459
02:15:07,080 --> 02:15:08,039
What about you?

1460
02:15:10,240 --> 02:15:11,959
Osman's Alp...

1461
02:15:12,520 --> 02:15:13,399
Konur..

1462
02:15:16,400 --> 02:15:18,999
You grew up in Great Seljuk...

1463
02:15:19,200 --> 02:15:22,239
...and commanded
the Viziers of the city.

1464
02:15:23,040 --> 02:15:24,239
Now you'll die here.

1465
02:15:30,200 --> 02:15:31,639
Who got you here?

1466
02:15:33,000 --> 02:15:34,599
Osman Bey did.

1467
02:15:36,800 --> 02:15:38,319
In a short time...

1468
02:15:39,480 --> 02:15:41,799
....he'll join you.

1469
02:15:42,640 --> 02:15:43,959
Osman Bey?

1470
02:15:49,040 --> 02:15:50,799
We don't fear death.

1471
02:15:52,600 --> 02:15:54,999
Maybe you'll live longer than us.

1472
02:16:01,600 --> 02:16:04,239
Once I kill you..

1473
02:16:04,240 --> 02:16:08,159
..I'll have a lot of time to think.

1474
02:16:09,320 --> 02:16:12,519
Don't worry at all Mesut.

1475
02:16:26,000 --> 02:16:27,439
What is it?

1476
02:16:29,560 --> 02:16:32,279
Commanders?

1477
02:16:34,280 --> 02:16:35,919
Are you disturbed?

1478
02:16:35,920 --> 02:16:39,119
It's not our place Mother Sultan.

1479
02:16:39,120 --> 02:16:41,999
Whatever you order is the rule.

1480
02:16:42,959 --> 02:16:44,999
Your word is our order.

1481
02:16:47,799 --> 02:16:50,439
I thought so too.

1482
02:16:53,040 --> 02:16:55,558
...there are a lot of executioners in Konya.

1483
02:17:31,000 --> 02:17:32,799
Sultan..

1484
02:17:32,799 --> 02:17:34,759
...there's word from Bayindir.

1485
02:17:34,760 --> 02:17:36,558
Osman.

1486
02:17:36,558 --> 02:17:37,799
He caught him.

1487
02:17:52,639 --> 02:17:54,398
Finally.

1488
02:17:57,600 --> 02:17:59,959
Send the town criers.

1489
02:18:00,760 --> 02:18:03,239
A lot of blood wi be spilled today

1490
02:18:06,959 --> 02:18:07,839
Take them away.

1491
02:19:05,240 --> 02:19:07,359
I was defeated by my nafs.

1492
02:19:09,480 --> 02:19:12,199
I became one of those who make mistakes.

1493
02:19:13,559 --> 02:19:16,959
Forgive this sinner servant of yours Allah...

1494
02:19:20,719 --> 02:19:22,239
Ameen.

1495
02:19:37,559 --> 02:19:38,799
Mother.

1496
02:19:40,120 --> 02:19:41,799
Alcicek..

1497
02:19:52,600 --> 02:19:53,999
Daughter...

1498
02:19:54,760 --> 02:19:56,799
Forgive me.

1499
02:19:57,800 --> 02:19:59,599
I couldn't protect you.

1500
02:20:00,000 --> 02:20:02,439
You should forgive me.

1501
02:20:03,360 --> 02:20:07,599
While I was making a mistake
I made you follow me.

1502
02:20:09,880 --> 02:20:12,999
Don't be like me okay?

1503
02:20:13,800 --> 02:20:16,199
Don't fall for your greed girl.

1504
02:20:19,760 --> 02:20:21,119
My flower.

1505
02:20:52,920 --> 02:20:56,279
Sultan Alaeddin Han..

1506
02:20:56,800 --> 02:21:01,199
..and Mother Ismihan Sultan.

1507
02:21:05,080 --> 02:21:09,559
I present to you,
the leader of traitors...

1508
02:21:10,000 --> 02:21:12,919
...Osman Bey.

1509
02:21:16,600 --> 02:21:18,959
Remove your hands!

1510
02:21:20,920 --> 02:21:22,879
Remove them!

1511
02:21:43,440 --> 02:21:47,279
At last! All traitors..

1512
02:21:47,800 --> 02:21:50,839
...are present in front of me...

1513
02:21:55,480 --> 02:21:57,999
...waiting to die together.

1514
02:21:59,000 --> 02:22:01,199
At last!

1515
02:22:03,440 --> 02:22:05,199
My Sultan.

1516
02:22:08,400 --> 02:22:10,799
Osman Bey...

1517
02:22:12,800 --> 02:22:16,559
Did you betray me because
I refused to give you soldiers?

1518
02:22:19,440 --> 02:22:22,879
Sultan Alaeddin..

1519
02:22:24,520 --> 02:22:28,159
..there's only one reason for all of this.

1520
02:22:29,800 --> 02:22:31,799
What is it?

1521
02:22:32,800 --> 02:22:36,239
I'd like to hear that before you die.

1522
02:22:38,600 --> 02:22:40,839
You worked with the enemy..

1523
02:22:42,000 --> 02:22:44,919
...to save yourself.

1524
02:22:46,400 --> 02:22:49,319
An enemy that...

1525
02:22:50,360 --> 02:22:53,079
...killed many brave men..

1526
02:22:53,520 --> 02:22:56,559
...and took many innocent lives!

1527
02:22:59,400 --> 02:23:01,519
My Sultan...

1528
02:23:01,840 --> 02:23:05,279
...you didn’t do anything about
all the evil plans...

1529
02:23:05,640 --> 02:23:08,439
...Mother Sultan made.

1530
02:23:14,400 --> 02:23:17,799
She took many innocent lives..

1531
02:23:19,600 --> 02:23:22,079
...spread disease over my lands...

1532
02:23:24,640 --> 02:23:26,999
...poisoned my son...

1533
02:23:27,360 --> 02:23:29,679
...imprisoned my Hatun...

1534
02:23:30,120 --> 02:23:32,199
...betrayed the Turks...

1535
02:23:32,640 --> 02:23:34,799
...and betrayed Islam!

1536
02:23:36,200 --> 02:23:38,079
But still..

1537
02:23:39,120 --> 02:23:42,239
...she is going to pay for what
she has done.

1538
02:23:47,240 --> 02:23:50,439
-If you're done telling lies--Mother.

1539
02:23:52,640 --> 02:23:55,519
Is anything true about...

1540
02:23:55,840 --> 02:23:57,879
...what Osman Bey said?

1541
02:24:02,280 --> 02:24:06,719
You should never listen to the
rebels who are after your throne...

1542
02:24:07,400 --> 02:24:09,399
..my Sultan..

1543
02:24:10,600 --> 02:24:13,039
...as they speak nothing but lies...

1544
02:24:15,000 --> 02:24:16,879
...and I've had enough!

1545
02:24:18,000 --> 02:24:20,599
The traitors will die today!

1546
02:24:25,520 --> 02:24:27,599
Look at that!

1547
02:24:28,840 --> 02:24:32,199
Hadrat Mother Sultan..

1548
02:24:33,200 --> 02:24:36,159
..once Osman here dies..

1549
02:24:37,240 --> 02:24:40,079
...will you let me keep his sword?

1550
02:24:41,680 --> 02:24:44,399
I don't care about it, Bayindir.

1551
02:24:44,840 --> 02:24:48,199
You really got used to giving away...

1552
02:24:48,760 --> 02:24:52,719
...things that aren't yours, Ismihan Hatun.

1553
02:24:53,600 --> 02:24:56,399
Just like the throne!

1554
02:24:59,040 --> 02:25:00,679
Isn't that right. Bayindir?

1555
02:25:00,960 --> 02:25:06,639
It doesn't belong to them,
yet she tries to share it with others.

1556
02:25:10,920 --> 02:25:14,719
Both the sword and the word..

1557
02:25:15,080 --> 02:25:16,839
...is Osman Bey's!

1558
02:25:17,160 --> 02:25:18,079
Oh, Allah!

1559
02:25:18,680 --> 02:25:20,199
Alps!

1560
02:25:30,600 --> 02:25:33,999
The throne is now Sultan Mesud's!

1561
02:25:39,720 --> 02:25:41,319
Alaeddin..

1562
02:25:43,560 --> 02:25:46,039
...surrender the throne without further bloodshed.

1563
02:25:46,400 --> 02:25:48,999
There is no surrender without bloodshed, Mesud!

1564
02:25:49,720 --> 02:25:53,359
You're all going to die today!

1565
02:25:55,120 --> 02:25:57,839
But you, Bayindir...

1566
02:25:58,760 --> 02:26:02,439
Yours is the greatest of betrayals.

1567
02:26:04,080 --> 02:26:07,639
Your death will not be easy.

1568
02:26:14,560 --> 02:26:16,879
And of course...

1569
02:26:17,400 --> 02:26:20,399
...not realizing such a great betrayal...

1570
02:26:21,120 --> 02:26:23,879
...happening in front of my eyes..

1571
02:26:24,000 --> 02:26:26,239
...would make me nothing but a fool.

1572
02:26:48,160 --> 02:26:50,159
Osman.

1573
02:27:10,720 --> 02:27:18,639
Visit our website for more: turkision.com